    "obs_and_metrics": [],
    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that North Atlantic Oscillation (NAO) variability is physically distinct across timescales, manifesting as shifts in jet stream latitude on interannual-decadal scales (<30 years) but as changes in jet stream strength on multidecadal scales (>30 years), with implications for climate predictability and reconstruction.",
