            "target_entity_instance": "ocean",
            "target_entity_type": "Realm",
            "paragraph": "We also make use of a 100 year present-day control sim\u00ad ulation of the high-resolution coupled General Circulation Model HiGEM (Shaffrey et al. 2009). This has an atmos\u00ad pheric resolution of 0.833\u00b0\u00d7 1.25\u00b0 in longitude-latitude with 38 levels, and an ocean resolution of 1\u20443\u00b0 with 40 lev\u00ad els.",
